OL,3,GNEWSAParish rates rises 'necessary' to
OL,4,Aremain sustainable
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe chair of the constables committee
OL,7,Fhas said that "it's important parishes
OL,8,Fput rates up when necessary".
OL,10,FAndy Jehan said parishes faced
OL,11,F"different challenges", but they needed
OL,12,Fto "make sure that they're
OL,13,Fsustainable".
OL,15,FParish rates pay for things like bin
OL,16,Fcollections, maintenance of byroads and
OL,17,Fchurches, as well as the honorary
OL,18,Fpolice.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
