OL,3,GNEWSAParish rates rises 'necessary' to
OL,4,Aremain sustainable
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe majority of parishes have published
OL,7,Ftheir rates for the coming year, with
OL,8,FSt Lawrence currently seeing the
OL,9,Fbiggest increase at 12%.
